<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australia 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the</p>
<p>Australian Hardcourt tennis championships at Memorial Drive on</p>
<p>Thursday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat 2-Mark Woodforde (Australia) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Jonathan Stark (U.S.) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat 6-David Prinosil (Germany) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Scott Draper (Australia) beat 8-Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 7-6 (7-2) 1-6 6-3</p>
</text>
